OL,3,GNEWSAHarbour authority jobs at risk
OL,4,Aafter ferry axed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirteen jobs at a harbour authority
OL,7,Fare at risk after the loss of a
OL,8,Fcross-Channel ferry service left it
OL,9,Ffacing a #3.5m loss of revenue.
OL,11,FPoole Harbour Commissioners cited
OL,12,FBrittany Ferries' "disappointing"
OL,13,Fdecision to end the Barfleur passenger
OL,14,Fand freight service between Poole and
OL,15,FCherbourg.
OL,17,FBrittany Ferries will operate the route
OL,18,Fbetween the two ports for the final
OL,19,Ftime on 31 October, ending a link that
OL,20,Fhas existed since 1985. The company
OL,21,Fsaid in June that the move was driven
OL,22,Fby its own financial challenges.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
